    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/city-3.webp" alt="Garage Building in Okotoks" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Garage building in Okotoks runs on the Town of Okotoks' rules, not the City of Calgary's, so a plan that works on a Calgary lot still needs checking with the Town before anyone pours a slab. This page covers what the Town publishes about detached garages and what one builder advertises for the town.</p><p>This site is advertising. It builds nothing, pulls no permits and holds no contractor licence. It puts Okotoks homeowners in touch with independent garage builders, who quote and contract directly with you. <strong>Call now on (403) 555-0162</strong> and ask for two or three comparable written quotes.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Okotoks</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Okotoks Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Detached garages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Single, double and triple garages on an Okotoks lot. One Okotoks builder advertises 14 by 20, 20 by 20, 20 by 22 and triple packages. See the <a href="/detached-garages/">detached garage page</a> for the full picture.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Garage packages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Fixed-size packages make quotes easier to compare, as long as you check what each one includes. Insulation, drywall, gas and the sub-panel are often priced as add-ons. More on the <a href="/garage-packages/">garage packages page</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Custom and oversized garages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">The Town does not let a garage exceed the height of the principal building, and its 2025 form asks for an engineer or architect above 55 m². Taller doors and workshop layouts need that checked early. See <a href="/custom-garages/">custom garages</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Garage replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">If an old garage is coming down, ask each builder whether removal is in the quote or priced separately. Confirm any demolition requirements with the Town of Okotoks. See <a href="/garage-replacement/">garage replacement</a>.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
